    "description": {
      "value": "A miniature mukradi, its chitin shrunken and pale, is coiled within this jar. Its hollow form grows to a Gargantuan shell when you open the jar. It emits one of three breath weapons, chosen by you. Each creature in the area must attempt a DC 34 basic Reflex save.\n\n- Acid Maw (acid) 10-foot-wide, 60-foot line of acid dealing 12d6 acid damage.\n- Flame Maw (fire) 60-foot cone of fire dealing 12d6 fire damage.\n- Shock Maw (electricity) 120-foot line of electricity dealing 12d6 electricity damage.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components Interact"
